      "content": "i guess, but it still feels like a lot of extra effort for nothing. like, if the outcome is always going to be zero, then the energy spent trying to \"create meaning\" feels like a waste. it's like trying to build a sandcastle right before a massive tide comes in. why go through the stress and the struggle if the universe has already decided the conclusion? it feels so illogical to keep fighting against the inevitable.",
